{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Simpic 是一款完全在裝置本機運作的相片整理工具，適合想清理重複相片、截圖、模糊影像與大型影片，並為手機騰出儲存空間的用戶。使用時無需註冊帳戶，程式不會上傳相片或整理記錄，所有分析均在本機完成。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-200.webp\">\n<h2>本機滑動整理與重複相片審核</h2>\n<p>以滑動方式快速分類相片，對角滑動可保留或放入待刪除清單。程式會在本機找出疑似重複與相似相片，並提供影像品質建議，亦可篩選模糊相片與連拍序列。智能任務可按日期範圍或儲存空間目標建立審核佇列，另備截圖搜尋與媒體最佳化等離線工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-16.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-17.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-18.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-19.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-20.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-21.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Simpic: Photo Cleaner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T00:18:58.176330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T00:03:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:17:37.795470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:17:38.626875+00:00","content_hash":"ada29b586d03c07ceee2e4d81b3eced5803257301885ce5680cd3b0c87b17cbc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}